        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Evaluate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\displaystyle\\int_0^4 x \\, \\textrm d x.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Evaluate [MATH: \\displaystyle\\int_0^4 x \\, \\textrm d x.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u222b_{0}^{4}xdx|= (x^{1 + 1})/(1 + 1)|_{0}^{4}; = (x^{2})/(2)|_{0}^{4}; = (4^{2})/(2) \u2212 (0^{2})/(2); = (16)/(2); = 8.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n[MATH: \u222b_{0}^{4}xdx|= (x^{1 + 1})/(1 + 1)|_{0}^{4}; = (x^{2})/(2)|_{0}^{4}; = (4^{2})/(2) \u2212 (0^{2})/(2); = (16)/(2); = 8.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nEvaluate [MATH: \\displaystyle\\int_0^4 x \\, \\textrm d x.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nTaking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n[MATH: \u222b_{0}^{4}xdx|= (x^{1 + 1})/(1 + 1)|_{0}^{4}; = (x^{2})/(2)|_{0}^{4}; = (4^{2})/(2) \u2212 (0^{2})/(2); = (16)/(2); = 8.]"
      },
